# Per-path token CHAIN ceilings, gated by `bbx budget`. itok's format,
# reused rather than reinvented -- a second format for one job would be two
# readings of one rule.
#
# WHAT THIS CEILING IS: the cost of REACHING a node -- root plus every
# ancestor plus itself -- which is what a worker pays before it sees any code.
# Measured on the target tier (gpt-oss:20b, 131,072 window, 28,543 entry cost,
# 102,529 working), the spec share is ~25%, so ~25,000 tokens.
#
# It forces a REVIEW, not a shrink. Set with real slack (~15-30%): a ceiling a
# hair above current turns every legitimate addition into a raise, and a
# threshold raised reflexively trains the reflex instead of catching the
# problem. Raises belong in a commit with their reason.
#
# RESET 2026-08-19 (T75), ~25% above measured, after T41 made `--depth rule`
# select and every chain fell ~35%. The numbers these replace were set against
# packs that carried §R and §B, so they gated nothing: `src/tdd` sat at 10,649
# under a 16,000 ceiling and could have grown by half unnoticed.
#
# Every node carries its own row now. `src/land` and `src/slice` inherited
# `src` by longest prefix, which IS checked (V104) -- but it left them less
# slack than their parent, which reads as deliberate and was not.
#
# Measured 2026-08-19, `bbx budget`: root 8,401 · src 8,527 · deepest
# src/tdd 10,649.
#
# RESET 2026-08-23, and this one is a RESTORATION rather than a raise. The
# rule three paragraphs up asks for 15-30% slack; measured against the
# numbers below it, every chain had between 0.0% and 2.5%, and four sat
# EXACTLY at their ceiling. T75's 25% was consumed by four days of real work
# -- CI, the hygiene family, six linters, T71 -- so the instrument had
# quietly become a ratchet on prose: a truthful one-line §C edit put four
# chains over, and the only way to record a guard was to delete words
# elsewhere.
#
# That is the failure the paragraph above names, arrived at from the other
# direction. A ceiling with no slack does not force a review; it forces a
# workaround, and the workaround is the reflex this file exists to prevent.
#
# The 20% is measured, not chosen for comfort: the largest chain after this
# reset is `src/tdd` at 16,000, which is 15.6% of the 102,529 working tokens
# the target tier leaves -- still inside the ~25% spec share this file's
# header sets as the budget. The binding constraint stayed where R41 found
# it, on competence rather than context.
#
# Measured 2026-08-23, `bbx budget`: root 10,399 · src 10,525 · deepest
# src/tdd 13,296.
